Accident Protection Cover: In the event of accidental bodily injury in relation Section 2
to the insured, during the policy period which shall within 12 months of its
occurrence be the sole and directly cause of a) Death or b) Permanent
Disablement.
Dependent Children’s Education Benefit: Section 2 A.1
If a claim for death, permanent total loss of two limbs, sight in both eyes, or
one eye and one limb is accepted, the Company will make a one-time
payment for each dependent child (up to age 21 and studying) of the lower of
Rs. 2,50,000 or 3% of the Sum Insured. This benefit is limited to two children.
